        "id": "WarwickP",
        "name": "Eternal Hunger",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Warwick's basic attacks deal bonus magic damage. If Warwick is below 50% health, he heals the same amount. If Warwick is below 25% health, this healing triples.",
        "bodyHtml": "Warwick's Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((6 ~ 55) + ([[si:scalead]]15% bonus Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]10% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> On-Hit.<br /><br />If Warwick is below 50% Health, he also heals for <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">100% of the damage dealt by <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Eternal Hunger</span></span>. If Warwick is below 25% health, the healing is increased to <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">250% of the damage dealt</span>.",
