        "id": "WarwickQ",
        "name": "Jaws of the Beast",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Warwick lunges forward and bites his target, dealing damage based on their maximum health and healing for damage dealt.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Tap:</span> Warwick lunges forward and bites, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(([[si:scalead]]120% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]100% Ability Power)) plus 6/7/8/9/10% max Health magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">healing for 25/37.5/50/62.5/75% of the damage dealt</span>.<br /><br /><span>Hold:</span> Warwick lunges and clamps his jaws on the target, leaping behind them. While clamped, Warwick follows all movement of the target. After releasing his hold, he does the same damage and healing.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability applies On-Hit and On-Attack effects, and does not Critically Strike. <br />While clamped, Warwick is immune to displacement.</span>",
