      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "WarwickW",
        "name": "Blood Hunt",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Warwick senses enemies below 50% health, gaining Move Speed toward and attack speed against them. When they fall below 25% health, he frenzies and these bonuses triple.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Warwick can sense champions below 50% Health, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">35/42.5/50/57.5/65% Move Speed</span> towards them. Spells and attacks against enemies below 50% Health grant <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">70/80/90/100/110% Attack Speed</span>. These effects are increased by 200% against enemies below 25% Health. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Warwick can briefly sense all enemies, and gains this Ability's passive effect against the closest champion for 8 seconds, regardless of Health. If no champions are found, this Ability's cooldown is reduced by 30%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Warwick can only passively sense enemies who were brought below 50% Health by allies.</span>",
