        "summary": "Warwick leaps in a direction (scaling with his bonus Move Speed), suppressing the first champion he collides with for 1.5 seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "Warwick leaps a huge distance that scales with his <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">Move Speed</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Suppressing</span> the first champion he collides with while he channels for 1.5 seconds. He attacks that champion 3 times over the duration, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(175/350/525 + ([[si:scalead]]167% bonus Attack Damage)) magic damage</span>. Warwick <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">heals for 100% of all damage dealt</span> during the channel.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability applies On-Hit and On-Attack effects 3 distinct times over its duration, and does not Critically Strike.<br />This Ability <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Down</span> enemies.</span>",
